# Email system

- Separate template rendering/preview verification from actual delivery.
- Do not send email to real users or start/resume a campaign as a test unless the user explicitly requests that operation.
- Preserve unsubscribe/preferences and transactional-vs-marketing distinctions.
- Keep provider webhook verification intact and handle duplicate delivery events idempotently.
- Use the existing template registry/rendering abstractions before adding one-off HTML email paths.
- Avoid logging full recipient datasets, tokens or sensitive provider payloads.
- For campaign/bulk-email changes, verify recipient selection and retry semantics before any live send.
